# Local bootstrap targets. `forge-launcher bootstrap` writes a complete project
# (agents, skills and their node_modules) and inits a git repo in it, so one
# created inside this tree would be committed as an embedded repository. Bootstrap
# outside this repo, or into scratch/ when it has to live alongside the source.
scratch/
